---
title: There is disk space
kind: verify
timeout: 30
---

A check fails when its block exits non-zero. This one fails when the file
system holding the runbook is 90% full or more.

```bash run
used=$(df -P . | awk 'NR == 2 { sub("%", "", $5); print $5 }')
echo "disk use: ${used}%"
test "$used" -lt 90
```
